# Shadowing Backend

Backend skeleton for an English listening practice web app built with FastAPI and a 3-tier architecture:

- Presentation: API routes/controllers and response schemas
- Business: services, interfaces, domain models, and business exceptions
- Data Access: adapters for external APIs and repositories for persistence

Run locally:

```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

